[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "一次審査に通ったぞ！\r\nやったな、恋鐘",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "004",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "006"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001010010,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "おお、そかそか\r\nま、うちなら当然やね～",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400101/7004001010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……意外とあっさりだな\r\nもっと喜ぶと思ってたけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001010020,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "いやいや、だってまだ一次審査よ？\r\n序盤も序盤やもん",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400101/7004001010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001010030,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ならうちが通って当たり前やろ？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400101/7004001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "通って当たり前って……すごい自信だな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001010040,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "当然よー\r\nなにせ、うちは天才やけんね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400101/7004001010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001010050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "やから、一次審査に通ったくらいじゃー\r\nそんな大はしゃぎはせんよー",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400101/7004001010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお、なるほどな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001010060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "それにプロデューサーも\r\nまだそこまで喜ばんでもいいっちゃよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400101/7004001010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001010070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "なにせ\r\nうちのホントのすごさがわかるのはこれからたい！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400101/7004001010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001010080,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "この調子で二次と三次もあっさり通って\r\n『W.I.N.G.』への出場も決める……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400101/7004001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001010090,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そんで、そのまま優勝して\r\nあっという間に『W.I.N.G.』を制覇しちゃるけんね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400101/7004001010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001010100,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "喜ぶならその時に目いっぱい喜ぶといいばい！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400101/7004001010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（そう簡単に上手くはいかないと思うが……\r\nけど、こういうところは恋鐘らしいな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、それは頼もしいな\r\n期待してるぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001010110,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んふふ～\r\nまぁ、うちにまかしとってー",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400101/7004001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001010120,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "すぐにプロデューサーを\r\nナンバー１アイドルのプロデューサーにしちゃるけんね！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400101/7004001010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まだ未熟なところはあるが\r\nけど、これからまだまだ恋鐘は輝いていけるはずだ）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わかった。その時が来るのを楽しみにしているよ\r\nそのために俺も恋鐘を精一杯サポートするからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7004001010130,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん！　よろしゅうねー\r\nプロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700400101/7004001010130"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]